{"root":"parasit","ipa":"/paˈrasit/","core":"寄生虫，寄生生物；比喻依附于他人或社会生存而不劳而获的人","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/paˈrasit/","zh":"寄生虫，寄生生物","phrases":[{"t":"parasit usus","zh":"肠道寄生虫"},{"t":"parasit sosial","zh":"社会寄生虫"},{"t":"hidup sebagai parasit","zh":"过着寄生生活"}],"examples":[{"t":"Kutu adalah contoh parasit luar pada hewan.","zh":"跳蚤是动物身上体外寄生虫的例子。"},{"t":"Dia hanya menjadi parasit bagi keluarganya.","zh":"他只是他家庭的一个寄生虫。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"parasit","ipa":"/paˈrasit/","zh":"寄生虫","phrase":{"t":"serangan parasit","zh":"寄生虫感染"},"example":{"t":"Obat ini membunuh parasit di dalam tubuh.","zh":"这种药能杀死体内的寄生虫。"}},{"w":"parasitisme","ipa":"/paɾasiˈtismə/","zh":"寄生现象，寄生状态","phrase":{"t":"hubungan parasitisme","zh":"寄生关系"},"example":{"t":"Parasitisme adalah bentuk interaksi antarorganisme.","zh":"寄生是生物间的一种相互作用形式。"}},{"w":"parasiter","ipa":"/paɾasiˈtɛr/","zh":"寄生的，寄生性的","phrase":{"t":"organisme parasiter","zh":"寄生生物"},"example":{"t":"Tanaman itu bersifat parasiter pada pohoninang.","zh":"那种植物对寄主树木具有寄生性。"}},{"w":"memparasiti","ipa":"/məm.pa.raˈsi.ti/","zh":"寄生于，吸血于","phrase":{"t":"memparasiti inang","zh":"寄生于宿主"},"example":{"t":"Serangga tersebut memparasiti daun tanaman.","zh":"那种昆虫寄生在植物的叶子上。"}}],"derSlugs":["parasit","parasitisme","parasiter","memparasiti"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T09:27:36.110Z","src":"base"}